00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:03,984
Test it in one move: can a reasonable person disagree?

2
00:00:03,984 --> 00:00:09,244
Water is necessary for life cannot be argued with; it is a fact.

3
00:00:09,244 --> 00:00:13,151
Bottled water should be taxed can, so it is a thesis.

4
00:00:13,151 --> 00:00:19,934
Two templates help until you no longer need them: a position plus because, or although plus a main clause.

